{
  "name": "POS Ledger & CRM (Fixed)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Fixed version checklist\n1. \"Append to Ledger\" writes to Document 19GKbPSysyctCGaJPGq7Je6D2E9HncQLFWbXqzbrjdpU, Sheet gid 0. Make sure Row 1 of that tab has EXACTLY these headers:\nOrderNumber, Day, Date, Time, Customer, Items, Subtotal, Discount, Tax, Total, Cost, Profit, PaymentMethod, OrderType, Note\n2. \"Read Ledger\" now points to the SAME document/sheet as #1 (this was the bug — it was pointing at a different, empty spreadsheet).\n3. \"Upsert Customer (CRM)\" writes to Document 1Db4bS17CsNXBEF3WIGElx8SMwos4xOYlVRW-K065LD4. Row 1 headers: Name, LastVisitDay, LastVisitDate, LastVisitTime, LastOrderTotal, LastPaymentMethod, LastOrderType\n4. \"Append to Ledger (Backup)\" writes to Document 1yolSJaTZzn_NA4M6Pleo1Z8Sk6SKFfy6t3vdKN9G_Yo — make sure that spreadsheet's first tab has the SAME headers as #1 before activating.\n5. Click Activate, then test.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "note-node",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-600, -80]
    },
    {
